{
  "dom_id": "step-e4149",
  "name": "Example: Solving Logarithmic Equations Containing a Constant on One Side",
  "problem": "If $\\log_2(x^2-6)=\\log_2(10),$ then what is the value of $x?$",
  "worked_solution": "Since the logarithms on both sides of the equation have the same base, we can equate the arguments. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}-6) & ={log}_{2}⁡(10) \\\\ {x}^{2}-6 & =10 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =16 \\\\ x & =\\pm 4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's now check for extraneous solutions by substituting back into the original equation: \n\n- Substituting $x=4$ back into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}-6) & ={log}_{2}⁡({4}^{2}-6) \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(16-6) \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(10).\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $x=4$ is a valid solution.\n\n- Substituting $x=-4$ back into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}-6) & ={log}_{2}⁡((-4)^{2}-6) \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(16-6) \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(10).\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $x=-4$ is a valid solution.\n\nSo, we conclude that the solutions are $x = \\pm 4.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e4149\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Solving Logarithmic Equations Containing a Constant on One Side</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e4149\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n 